#. あっ、来た来た！
msgctxt "0001 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Ah, there he is!"
msgstr ""

#. 重役も社長も会長もすっ飛ばして、
#. 大統領クラスの遅刻だべ！
msgctxt "0002 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"This is worse than being late for your wedding, the\n"
"birth of your son, and your own funeral, all at once!"
msgstr ""

#. まったく…今頃のこのこやって来るとは…
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Jeez. To show up now, like it's no big deal..."
msgstr ""

#. ひ、人に…徹夜させといて…
#. よく…のん気に…寝てられるわね…
msgctxt "0004 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You made us s-stay up all night, while you slept like\n"
"a b-baby in your bed...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝日奈さんが言った通りだった。
#. そこには、霧切さん以外の全員が揃っていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just like Hina said, everyone was there. Besides\n"
"Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、彼らは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then I noticed...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>円陣を組んで、
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“何か”<CLT><CLT 4>を取り囲むようにしていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They'd formed a circle around...<CLT><CLT 3>something<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その“何か”を、ボクの視界が捉えた瞬間…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As soon as I saw what that \"something\" was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …え！？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What the—!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは思わず声を上げていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Before I could catch myself, I'd cried out.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼らの手元には…<CLT><CLT 3>解体されたモノクマ<CLT><CLT 4>が……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Spread out in front of them...were <CLT><CLT 3>the remains of\n"
"Monokuma<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何を…してるの…？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What are you doing?"
msgstr ""

#. 見ての通りだべ！
#. 分解して、中の仕組みを確かめてんだ！
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"What does it look like? We're dismantling it to see\n"
"what makes it tick."
msgstr ""

#. ぶ、分解…！？
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Dismantling!?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、それって…モノクマだよね？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But I mean...that's Monokuma you're messing with,\n"
"right!?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだよ、モノクマだよ。
msgctxt "0016 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Yeah, that's right."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんなあっさりと…
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "She's not even fazed...!"
msgstr ""

#. …安心しろ。危険はない。
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Relax. There's no danger."
msgstr ""

#. 危険が…ないって…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You say that, but..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんだよ、これ…？
#. 一体どうなってるんだ…！？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What is this!? What are you guys doing!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、これってどういう事なの！？
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Seriously, what are you thinking!?"
msgstr ""

#. だって…モノクマを分解なんかして…
#. 危険がない訳ないのに…
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"How can you say tearing apart something like that\n"
"isn't dangerous?"
msgstr ""

#. 間抜け…寝坊なんかするから、
#. 状況に置いていかれるんだ。
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Idiot. If you hadn't been sleeping in, you'd already\n"
"know what's going on."
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、これってどういう事なの！？
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Seriously, what are you thinking!?"
msgstr ""

#. だって…モノクマを分解なんかして…
#. 危険がない訳ないのに…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"How can you say tearing apart something like that\n"
"isn't dangerous?"
msgstr ""

#. ないんだから…しょうがないじゃん…
msgctxt "0026 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It isn't! What do you want us to say?"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、これってどういう事なの！？
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Seriously, what are you thinking!?"
msgstr ""

#. だって…モノクマを分解なんかして…
#. 危険がない訳ないのに…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"How can you say tearing apart something like that\n"
"isn't dangerous?"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、これってどういう事なの！？
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Seriously, what are you thinking!?"
msgstr ""

#. だって…モノクマを分解なんかして…
#. 危険がない訳ないのに…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"How can you say tearing apart something like that\n"
"isn't dangerous?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うるさいわね…
#. 話に付いて来られないなら…黙っててよ…
msgctxt "0031 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You're so a-annoying... If you can't keep up with\n"
"wh-what's going on, just stop talking..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>見事に…バラバラだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like it's been professionally disassembled...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…どうして、こんな事に？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How is that possible?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマを分解なんかして、
#. 危険がない訳ないのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Tearing apart something like that isn't dangerous...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなはどうして、こんな事を？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have to figure out what's going on...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>とにかく話を聞いてみよう…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better hear what everyone has to say.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. しゃーねーな。
#. 苗木っちの為に俺が説明してやんべ！
msgctxt "0037 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Well, I guess I'll handle this. I'll explain what's\n"
"goin' on, Makoto. Cuz that's how much I like ya!"
msgstr ""

#. 十神っちが、モノクマのヌイグルミ化に気付き、
#. そんで、俺らで分解したって訳だ！
msgctxt "0038 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Byakuya found this li'l fella layin' around, then we\n"
"tore it apart!"
msgstr ""

#. 全然わかんないよ…
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That doesn't explain anything..."
msgstr ""

#. 昨日の夜時間になる直前…
#. 俺はモノクマを訪ねて、この体育館に来たんだ。
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Just before we went to bed last night, I came to the\n"
"gym to try and talk to Monokuma."
msgstr ""

#. 霧切がいなくなった件で、
#. 進展がないかをモノクマから探る為にな…
msgctxt "0041 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I wanted to see if he had any new information about\n"
"Kyoko's disappearance."
msgstr ""

#. 案の定、モノクマはこの体育館にいた。
#. ただし…
msgctxt "0042 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And I found him here, just like normal. However..."
msgstr ""

#. その時はすでに、なんの反応もない、
#. ただのヌイグルミ状態だったがな…
msgctxt "0043 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...when I found him, he was no more than a regular\n"
"toy. He didn't react, didn't say a word."
msgstr ""

#. モノクマが…動かなくなったって事…？
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're saying...he wasn't moving at all?"
msgstr ""

#. しばらく待って夜時間になったが、
#. 相変わらず、モノクマは動かないままだった…
msgctxt "0045 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I waited there until nighttime officially began, but\n"
"still Monokuma laid there motionless."
msgstr ""

#. 俺は、すぐに全員を呼び集め、
#. 慎重に確認を繰り返した。
msgctxt "0046 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I gathered everyone up as quickly as possible so they\n"
"could take a look."
msgstr ""

#. だが…やはりモノクマは動かなかった…
msgctxt "0047 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Even then, he still didn't make a move."
msgstr ""

#. そこで、この解体作業に取り掛かったという訳だ。
msgctxt "0048 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "So I immediately initiated the disassembly process."
msgstr ""

#. 白夜様の…天才的なアイデアよ…
#. モ、モノクマの構造を確かめる…チャンスって…
msgctxt "0049 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"It was Master's s-stroke of genius. A chance to find\n"
"out what m-made Monokuma tick..."
msgstr ""

#. 分解してわかったが、
#. こいつは、<CLT 3>かなり高度な機械<CLT>みたいだぞ。
msgctxt "0050 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"One thing we discovered is that he's quite a\n"
"<CLT 3>sophisticated machine<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、ただのラジコンとは訳が違うようだな…
msgctxt "0051 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It's leagues beyond any normal remote-control toy."
msgstr ""

#. まったく…どこのヒマ人が、
#. こんな物を作ったんだろうな…
msgctxt "0052 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Who has enough free time to invest in something\n"
"like that, anyway...?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんな事より…
#. どうして急に動かなくなったんだろう…
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"B-But besides that, what I'm wondering is...why did he\n"
"stop moving all of a sudden?"
msgstr ""

#. 故障の可能性もあると思って分解してみたんだが、
#. これといった原因は見つからなかった。
msgctxt "0054 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I thought maybe he'd malfunctioned, but we didn't find\n"
"any cause as we were taking him apart."
msgstr ""

#. 故障じゃないとすると…
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So if he didn't break down..."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、モノクマを操っていた黒幕に
#. 予期せぬ何かが起きた…
msgctxt "0056 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Then maybe something happened to his puppeteer, the\n"
"mastermind. Something unexpected."
msgstr ""

#. そう考える他あるまい。
msgctxt "0057 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I can't imagine any other possibility."
msgstr ""

#. 予期せぬ…何か…？
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Something...unexpected?"
msgstr ""

#. き、きっと逃げたのよ…白夜様に恐れをなして…
msgctxt "0059 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"They were probably so s-scared of Master, they ran\n"
"away in t-terror..."
msgstr ""

#. 急病で倒れたんじゃない？
msgctxt "0060 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Or maybe they got sick or something?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、モノクマアナウンスは今朝も流れてたよね？
#. 黒幕に何かあったなら、誰があのアナウンスを…
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But Monokuma made his announcement this morning,\n"
"right? Who was that, if not the mastermind?"
msgstr ""

#. …自動再生だ。
#. それが時間になって流れただけだろう。
msgctxt "0062 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Oh, I'm sure that's a recording. It's set to a timer,\n"
"and plays as necessary."
msgstr ""

#. そっか…毎日同じセリフだったもんね…
msgctxt "0063 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That's true. He says the exact same thing every day,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. なぁ、みんな…
#. のん気に、ご歓談を楽しんでる場合じゃなくってよ…
msgctxt "0064 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hey, guys? I don't think now's a good time for light\n"
"conversation..."
msgstr ""

#. こんなん出てきました。
#. これってなんだべ？
msgctxt "0065 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I just found something. What is it...?"
msgstr ""

#. こ、これって…！！
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-It's...!"
msgstr ""

#. …なんだべ？
msgctxt "0067 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "It's what?"
msgstr ""

#. …<CLT 3>爆弾<CLT>だな。
#. モノクマに内蔵されていた物のようだ。
msgctxt "0068 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"A <CLT 3>bomb<CLT>. There's one installed in every Monokuma\n"
"robot, I'm sure."
msgstr ""

#. ば、爆弾んんんんッ！？
msgctxt "0069 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "A b-b-b-bomb!?"
msgstr ""

#. 危険物じゃん！　横っちょにどけて置かないと！
msgctxt "0070 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "That's super bad! We need to get rid of it!"
msgstr ""

#. りょ、了解だべ…
msgctxt "0071 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "R-Roger that!"
msgstr ""

#. ちなみに、爆弾には<CLT 3>振動センサー<CLT>が付いているようだ。
#. 気を付けろ。振動を与えると爆発するぞ。
msgctxt "0072 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It appears the bomb has a <CLT 3>motion sensor<CLT>. Any sudden\n"
"movements, it's sure to go off."
msgstr ""

#. し、振動…！？　マジで…！？
#. そ、そんなん…急に手の震えが…ッ！！
msgctxt "0073 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"M-Motion sensor!? For serious!? Agh...I'm starting to\n"
"get all shaky...!"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと！　しっかりしてよ！
#. 男でしょ！？
msgctxt "0074 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey! Get it together! You're a man, aren't ya!?"
msgstr ""

#. だ、大丈夫だ…オロオロオロ…
msgctxt "0075 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I-I'm fine! I'm totally fine! Ah, ah, ah!"
msgstr ""

#. 大丈夫じゃないじゃん！
#. オロオロしてんじゃん！
msgctxt "0076 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You're so NOT fine! You're all \"ah ah ah\"!"
msgstr ""

#. …言い忘れていたが、
#. 今は、振動センサーはオフになっているようだ。
msgctxt "0077 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Oh, I probably should have mentioned. The motion\n"
"sensor is off right now."
msgstr ""

#. アッハッハッハ！　焦らせんなって！
msgctxt "0078 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Ha-ha-ha-ha! Jeez, don't scare me like that!"
msgstr ""

#. きっと、あんたって、
#. 今世紀で１番頼りにならないヤツだよね！
msgctxt "0079 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"God, you're like the world's most spineless worm of\n"
"the century!"
msgstr ""

#. 早くも決定？　今世紀始まったばっかだべ！
msgctxt "0080 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hey, come on! The century's just getting started!\n"
"Don't call the race already..."
msgstr ""

#. い、いいから…早く爆弾を置きなさいよ…
#. あ、あんたが持ってると…ロクな事にならないし…
msgctxt "0081 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Whatever... Just h-hurry up and put the bomb down.\n"
"Hanging onto it's not g-gonna do anyone any good..."
msgstr ""

#. はいよ、了解だべ…
msgctxt "0082 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Oh yeah, good call."
msgstr ""

#. 置いたべ！　これで一件落着だべ！
msgctxt "0083 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Okay, it's down! Everything's all good!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンの手で床に置かれた爆弾。
#. だけど、それよりも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro put the bomb down, but that wasn't my main\n"
"concern at that point.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの目は…解体されたモノクマの方に、
#. 釘付けになっていた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>My eyes were glued to Monokuma's remains...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>急に動かなくなったモノクマ…
#. その理由は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He'd just stopped moving all of a sudden.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それを操っていた黒幕に、
#. “予期せぬ何か”が起きたから…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Was it really because something had happened to the\n"
"mastermind that they weren't expecting...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、なんでだろう？
#. その“何か”って言葉を聞くと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But what could that have been? When I thought about\n"
"it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>昨日の事を…思い出すのは……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I couldn't help but think back to the night before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>昨日の…あの覆面の襲撃の事を…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Being attacked by that masked figure...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、苗木ってば？
msgctxt "0091 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey, uh...Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. え、じゃねーべ！　ちゃんと話聞いてたんか？
msgctxt "0093 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Don't \"huh\" us! Did you hear a thing we just said!?"
msgstr ""

#. …話？
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. き、聞いていなかったの？
#. ボーっとしてんじゃないわよ…死にかけの動物？
msgctxt "0095 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"So that's a n-no. What are you, some k-kind of\n"
"brain-dead farm animal...?"
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめん…
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. あのね、モノクマの解体も終わったし、
#. これからどうしようかって話になったんだけど…
msgctxt "0097 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"We were saying, since we're done dismantling Monokuma,\n"
"what should we do now?"
msgstr ""

#. さらなる攻勢をかける事にした。
msgctxt "0098 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "And we've decided to continue our offensive assault."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕の正体を突き止める為に、
#. <CLT 3>“学園長室”<CLT>に突入するぞ。
msgctxt "0099 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"To try and uncover the mastermind's true identity,\n"
"we're going to break into the <CLT 3>headmaster's room<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. が、学園長室に…？
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "R-Really...?"
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕の動きが止まった今こそチャンスだ。
#. そうだろう…？
msgctxt "0101 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Since the mastermind appears to have stopped all\n"
"activity, now's our chance. Wouldn't you agree?"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だけど…
#. もし、途中で黒幕が戻って来たりしたら…
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"B-But...if the mastermind comes back while we're in\n"
"there..."
msgstr ""

#. …怖いなら、ここに１人で残っていろ。
msgctxt "0103 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you're scared, you're welcome to stay here by\n"
"yourself."
msgstr ""

#. し、飼育小屋にでも入ってれば…？
#. チキンね…６羽目のチキンよ…
msgctxt "0104 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Or go l-live in the chicken coop, with all the o-other\n"
"chickens. You can be chicken number s-six..."
msgstr ""

#. これは戦いだ。俺達と黒幕の殺し合いなんだ。
#. 悠長な事は言ってられん…
msgctxt "0105 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"This is a battle, a fight to the death between us and\n"
"the mastermind. We don't have time to deliberate."
msgstr ""

#. 殺し合いとかはアレだけど…
#. チャンスなのは確かだよね…
msgctxt "0106 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I mean, I don't wanna hafta kill each other, or\n"
"anyone else. But we have a chance now..."
msgstr ""

#. …お前はどうする？　
#. 戦うのか？　逃げるのか？
msgctxt "0107 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So? What are you going to do? Are you going run away,\n"
"or are you going to fight?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. わ、わかった…ボクも行くよ…
msgctxt "0109 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're right. I'll go with you."
msgstr ""

#. では、決まりだ。
#. 学園長室に乗り込むぞ。
msgctxt "0110 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Okay then. We're going to break into the headmaster's\n"
"room."
msgstr ""

#. おそらく、ここが最大の山場だ。
#. 気を引き締めて行くぞ。
msgctxt "0111 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Everything comes down to this moment. Anything can\n"
"happen, so prepare yourselves."
msgstr ""

#. 白夜様に…付いてイきます…
#. ど、どこまでも…！
msgctxt "0112 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I'll follow you a-anywhere, Master! To all the ends\n"
"of the E-Earth!"
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃん…力を貸してね…
msgctxt "0113 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Sakura...if you can hear me, lend me your strength..."
msgstr ""

#. やれる…俺はやれる男だ！
#. 全宇宙の意志の力に守られてんだ！
msgctxt "0114 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I can do this... I'm a man, and I can do this! I've\n"
"got the will of the entire universe on my side!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらは、思い思いの方法で決意を固めつつ、
#. 体育館を後にし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We each found determination in our own ways, and when\n"
"we were ready, we left the gym.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園長室のある“学校４階”へと向かった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0116 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Our target was the headmaster's room, on the 4th floor\n"
"of the school.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
